raw_discovery_candidates.cheap_validation:
Use price histories from the trade archives; no LLM is needed for the baseline. Build the martingale benchmark, then test whether the agents' p_7d beats 'price today' as a predictor of the price in 7 days, using the Numinous score S.

Pass:
- mean S < 0 with a CI excluding 0;
- rank IC > 0.05 on >= 1,000 market-weeks;
- it beats a 1-week momentum baseline;
- simulated maker-entry PnL is positive after fees.

Fail if the skill disappears once markets with top-decile liquidity are removed and none remains elsewhere, or if it exists only in markets under $5k depth.
